# CAR with a fiducial-point offset: PV1_0 = 1 (apply the offset), PV1_1 =
# phi_0 = 20, PV1_2 = theta_0 = 10 (Paper II sect. 2.5; wcslib
# cel.offset). The projection is shifted so that (x, y) = (0, 0) is at
# native (20, 10). Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: PVi_0..2 on the longitude axis, fiducial offset applied
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---CAR'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--CAR'
CRVAL1  = 40.0
CRVAL2  = 25.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.1
CDELT2  = 0.1
PV1_0   = 1.0
PV1_1   = 20.0
PV1_2   = 10.0
